# Multiball from the first lock through to the END of the mode, on iomoon at the
# Netherlands country default (SW40-2/3/4 = country 4, English text, F11).
#
# scripts/keyscripts/iomoon-jackpot.keys stops with Multiball still running, so
# nothing in the corpus showed the mode ending, the ball ending under it, or the
# game carrying on afterwards.  This walk is that script's route plus the tail.
#
# The start is a chain of blocking waits (F22) and the simulator's keys act on one
# ball at a time, so most of this script is shepherding:
#   * after each lock, Down to the ball just served, then plunge
#   * sub_DC6AC releases with 0xEE and waits for a SCOOP report -- codes 0x21/0x22
#     only, so LCtrl+H.  A lane will not answer it, and the routine re-issues 0xEE
#     every five seconds forever
#   * the second released ball wants its own scoop report
#
# The tail, and what each step is for:
#   drain 3 -> 2          Multiball still running
#   drain 2 -> 1          Multiball ENDS (3.2.1): LD2 and LR21 go out and the
#                         firmware's ORBITS letter count [413C:0102] resets 6 -> 0
#   bull's-eye 2, ramp 2  the proof it ended -- they now pay their base 50,001 and
#                         11,111 instead of the Jackpot and Superjackpot
#   drain the last ball   end of ball, and the score has crossed the extra-ball
#                         threshold, so PLAYER EXTRA BALL comes up
#   plunge and play       the banner stands for about 70 s of play before the
#                         display settles back to "1 2 / PLAYER BALL"
#
# Needs no pre-seeded store: the six KEYCODE_5 presses below bank one credit at
# country 4, after the first attract cycle.
#
# Keys: S lane 4; LCtrl+B bull's-eye 1; RCtrl+B bull's-eye 2; RCtrl+R ramp 2;
#       LCtrl+H scoop 1; J Jupiter; Y/U lanes 1/2; W/E bumpers; O lane 10;
#       Q drain; Down next ball; Space plunge; 5 coin; 1 start.
    40 tap 8 KEYCODE_1
  6641 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  6721 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  6801 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  6881 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  6961 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  7041 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  7200 mark credit
  7210 tap 10 KEYCODE_1
  7400 mark ball-1-start
  7410 tap 40 KEYCODE_SPACE
  7700 mark orbits-lane4-1
  7710 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
  7790 mark orbits-letter-1
  7800 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
  7900 mark orbits-lane4-2
  7910 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
  7990 mark orbits-letter-2
  8000 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
  8100 mark orbits-lane4-3
  8110 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
  8190 mark orbits-letter-3
  8200 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
  8300 mark orbits-lane4-4
  8310 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
  8390 mark orbits-letter-4
  8400 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
  8500 mark orbits-lane4-5
  8510 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
  8590 mark orbits-letter-5
  8600 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
  8700 mark orbits-lane4-6
  8710 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
  8790 mark orbits-letter-6
  8800 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
  8900 mark orbits-complete
  9100 mark jupiter-lock-1
  9110 tap 10 KEYCODE_J
  9280 mark replacement-ball-1
  9290 tap 10 KEYCODE_DOWN
  9350 tap 40 KEYCODE_SPACE
  9500 mark jupiter-lock-2-multiball
  9510 tap 10 KEYCODE_J
  9700 mark follow-the-released-ball
  9710 tap 10 KEYCODE_DOWN
  9790 tap 10 KEYCODE_DOWN
  9900 mark scoop-1-takes-the-released-ball
  9910 tap 10 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_H
 10050 mark plunge-the-served-ball
 10060 tap 40 KEYCODE_SPACE
 10150 tap 10 KEYCODE_DOWN
 10220 tap 10 KEYCODE_DOWN
 10300 mark multiball-running
 10310 tap 10 KEYCODE_Y
 10500 mark scoop-1-takes-the-second-released-ball
 10510 tap 10 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_H
 10700 tap 40 KEYCODE_SPACE
 10900 mark jackpot-1
 10910 tap 10 KEYCODE_RCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
 11200 mark superjackpot-1
 11210 tap 10 KEYCODE_RCONTROL,KEYCODE_R
 11500 mark jackpot-2
 11510 tap 10 KEYCODE_RCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
 11800 mark superjackpot-2
 11810 tap 10 KEYCODE_RCONTROL,KEYCODE_R
 12100 mark multiball-three-balls
 12200 mark drain-first-of-three
 12210 tap 10 KEYCODE_Q
 12500 mark two-balls-left
 12510 tap 10 KEYCODE_DOWN
 12600 tap 10 KEYCODE_Q
 12900 mark multiball-over-one-ball-left
 13000 tap 10 KEYCODE_DOWN
 13100 tap 10 KEYCODE_RCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
